# Keep binary media out of Cursor's index and workspace snapshots.
#
# These files are large, numerous, and have been rewritten many times by image
# compression and format conversion (PNG -> JPG -> WebP). Every past version of
# every image was retained in the snapshot store, which grew a 154 MB workspace
# into 3 GB snapshot packs and filled the C: drive.
#
# Excluding them costs nothing: the agent reads image *paths* from js/content.js,
# never the pixel data.

assets/**/*.webp
assets/**/*.png
assets/**/*.jpg
assets/**/*.jpeg
assets/**/*.gif
assets/**/*.mp4
assets/**/*.mov

# Generated cursor art - regenerate with scripts/make_pixel_cursors.py.
assets/cursor/

# Local dev artifacts.
scripts/_*
